{"id":"n62100-1-6","stage":2,"title":"질서 · 秩序","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62100-1-6-1","ko":"여러분, 안전을 위해서 질서를 지켜 주세요.","zh":"大家为了安全，请遵守秩序。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여러분,","meaning":"诸位，各位，大家","explanation":"여러분：诸位，各位，大家","readings":[{"term":"여러분","audio":"/audio/b9900788f06b605eb770.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28028","senseId":"1","lemma":"여러분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여러분","audio":"/audio/b9900788f06b605eb770.mp3"}},{"text":"안전을","meaning":"安全","explanation":"안전：安全；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"안전","audio":"/audio/beff908259d220501203.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71373","senseId":"1","lemma":"안전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안전을","audio":"/audio/ed9a46056fa293fc5aff.mp3"}},{"text":"위해서","meaning":"为了","explanation":"위하다：为了；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"위하다","audio":"/audio/96303fbb42bf3d764fa0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29736","senseId":"1","lemma":"위하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"위해서","audio":"/audio/8a9374054932c887ee63.mp3"}},{"text":"질서를","meaning":"秩序","explanation":"질서：秩序；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"질서","audio":"/audio/5c921269f86ce84f722e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62100","senseId":"1","lemma":"질서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"질서를","audio":"/audio/8acd1f014847d980ad40.mp3"}},{"text":"지켜","meaning":"遵守","explanation":"지키다：遵守；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"지키다","audio":"/audio/43f3170b8d3dc6fa99c2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29754","senseId":"4","lemma":"지키다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지켜","audio":"/audio/0019d9a9c3af04c2060e.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245"